WEBVTT

00:00:28.602 --> 00:00:30.030
This is mine.

00:00:30.594 --> 00:00:31.744
Nothing much,

00:00:31.768 --> 00:00:33.612
just a crocodile on the street.

00:00:33.636 --> 00:00:35.154
(Laughter)

00:00:35.178 --> 00:00:38.499
This is an urgent impact
of climate change:

00:00:38.523 --> 00:00:40.355
over sinking cities.

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:46.349
Here, you can see
the urbanization of Bangkok,

00:00:46.373 --> 00:00:49.401
growing in every direction,

00:00:49.425 --> 00:00:52.975
shifting from porous, agricultural land --

00:00:53.894 --> 00:00:57.161
the land that can breathe
and absorb water --

00:00:57.185 --> 00:00:59.446
to a concrete jungle.